# Build-context hygiene for the optimus-app build (context '.' in docker-compose.yml).
# Dockerfile.app does `COPY . .` then `pnpm build`, so without this the whole
# repo — node_modules, .git, model_cache (~10GB) — uploads to the daemon each
# app build. The vlm/qwen/gemma services build from their own subfolders and
# are unaffected by this file.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
client/dist
dist
model_cache
*.log
.env
vlm-cache
llama-models
.idea
.vscode
# Per-service build subfolders are not needed by the app image
vlm-service/wheels
qwen-vl-service/wheels
gemma-vl-service/wheels